Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who ceaselessly hone the art\Nof killing are known as masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.05,0:00:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These lethal abilities, dutifully\Npassed down through many generations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have become what are\Ncalled modified bloodlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.81,0:00:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the story of one such master,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.93,0:00:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru Gero of the Poison Clan\Nand his greatest challenge yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.97,0:00:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.21,0:00:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No mama, lots of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.91,0:01:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill or kiss Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.74,0:01:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.75,0:02:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's a photo of Toshiki Hanamaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.11,0:02:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the bug master and a long-time\Ncolleague, and also my buddy. Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.55,0:02:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is a guy who's getting married?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.85,0:02:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sure got that killer vibe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.01,0:02:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you have a great time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.97,0:02:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kinosaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.21,0:02:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like there's also\Na butterfly for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.05,0:02:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear Mei Kinosaki,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.09,0:02:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you are faring well despite this\Nearly summer heat we're experiencing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.01,0:02:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gato has informed me of your arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.57,0:02:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot tell you how thankful I am you're\Nassisting with his search for a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.01,0:02:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your dedication and\Nselflessness are so admirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.07,0:02:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would be honored if you\Nwould attend my humble wedding,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.09,0:02:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I may be able to express\Nmy gratitude in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.99,0:02:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yours truly, Toshiki Hanamaki, Bug Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.49,0:02:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a stand-up guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.37,0:03:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been invited\Nto a wedding before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.93,0:03:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.84,0:03:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to make sure I'm dressed the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, it is his special day. You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.83,0:03:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a wedding is a great place to meet\Nnew people, including potential paramours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama's gonna need a brand new outfit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.69,0:03:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your treat, okie-dokie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.29,0:03:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was expecting a bug thing,\Nbut he outdid himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.95,0:03:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like it was ripped straight\Nfrom the pages of a fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.99,0:03:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.53,0:03:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out, that's not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.37,0:03:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't been doing\Ntoo hot, huh, boss man?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.37,0:04:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leaning too hard on\Nyour modified bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.89,0:04:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was only a temporary pick-me-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.73,0:04:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.23,0:04:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinosaki, this is Tsunagi,\Nthe Needle Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a friend of mine,\Nlike the Bug Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.97,0:04:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.91,0:04:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess what, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ad made bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.89,0:04:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's up for Undeadsneyland this weekend?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.07,0:04:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will we get to meet the real\NUndeadsney, Pa? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.67,0:04:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm planning the most optimal ride route.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I leave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.99,0:04:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a great dad, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.49,0:04:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With three little clones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.21,0:04:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're Kinosaki, that must mean you're\Nthe big guy's marriage advisor, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be rough. I feel\Nfor you. See? You get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.07,0:04:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We would like to welcome all of our honored\Nguests who have gathered here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.81,0:04:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bride and groom\Ncannot thank you enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.33,0:04:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now please join us as\Nwe celebrate the union
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.01,0:04:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,between Toshiki Hanamaki\Nand Anna Kawakita.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.39,0:05:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to bring the underworld out\Nof the darkness and into the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.25,0:05:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The black market organ dealers,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.63,0:05:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of the drug cartels.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.17,0:05:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must join hands in unity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.23,0:05:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ending this ridiculous forced isolation\Nonce and for all has always been my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad you made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only showed up tonight because\Nyou can't seem to take a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.55,0:05:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you think getting on\Nmy good side is going to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.03,0:05:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,win your family any favors\Nwith my grandmother,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.55,0:05:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry if I gave you the wrong impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.45,0:05:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to have a drink together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're up for it, Hikaru Gero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.91,0:05:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you care to join me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.31,0:06:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afraid it's non-alcoholic,\Nsince you're underage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.61,0:06:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gero, did you hear that story?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.63,0:06:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.01,0:06:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the two of them first met.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.81,0:06:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anna got into trouble while\Nmountain climbing and he saved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.71,0:06:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds just like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.21,0:06:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinosaki, do you think I'll ever\Nget to have a wedding this perfect?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.07,0:07:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.37,0:07:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, you have me in your corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.23,0:07:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Toshiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure looks like you've got plenty of\Nhappiness and love, don't you, Bug Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.97,0:07:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It ain't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.31,0:07:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our couple met in the mountains,\Nand now spend their days camping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're both fans of hiking naturally,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.01,0:07:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but equally enjoy chatting\Naround the campfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.63,0:07:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take another Chateaubriand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.71,0:07:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And at night, while looking\Nup at the starry sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.51,0:07:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.53,0:07:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you supposed to be\Ngiving a big speech soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.89,0:07:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to cover for me! Oh, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.97,0:07:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the spider?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.33,0:07:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it, Juliet Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.21,0:07:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You care about him just as much as I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.37,0:08:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and neither one of us want\Nanything to ruin his wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.91,0:08:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, this is the most\Nimportant day of Toshiki's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.11,0:08:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.75,0:08:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In exactly five minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of you rush your assigned\Nentrances and kill whoever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.69,0:08:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And remember, the more\Nstiffs, the bigger your bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.65,0:08:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as Buggy and his master\Nfriends start fighting back, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.61,0:08:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.71,0:08:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While they're distracted, I'll\Nplant a fancy firework on the bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.05,0:08:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet she'll make a pretty\Ncolor when she goes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.11,0:08:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a picture that the\Ngroom won't be able to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.11,0:08:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my gift too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.03,0:08:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that's what I get for\Nhiring mercs on the Dark Nav. Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.39,0:08:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's time for plan B?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.14,0:09:04.45,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur0.3\bord0\shad0\fscx90\fs60\c&H8477F3&\pos(430,0)}Firestorm Labyrinth
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.97,0:09:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Firestorm Labyrinth!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look what you made me do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.91,0:09:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here I was planning on\Nusing those bombs on the guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.95,0:09:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.63,0:09:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.87,0:09:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess that's the way\Nthe cookie goes kaboom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.89,0:09:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, all I really care\Nabout is paying back that Bugmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.49,0:09:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man responsible for stealing\Nthe only true spark in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.11,0:09:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.23,0:09:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back in those days, I didn't\Ngive a crap about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.39,0:09:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,School, work, marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.55,0:09:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never felt there was\Na point to any of it.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.99,0:09:38.24,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fnGeorgia\an8\fs14\blur0.3\c&H1B1705&\pos(232,20)\frz18.48\frx10\fry2}Amount: 50,000,000
