Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.99,0:09:38.24,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fnGeorgia\an8\fs8\b1\blur0.3\c&H4C3F17&\fax0.05\frx10\fry2\frz19.53\pos(241,164)}Name:
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.99,0:09:38.24,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\an8\fs18\blur0.3\c&H897534&\fax0.05\frx10\fry2\pos(337.5,155.5)\frz20.61}Hiroshi Takanashi
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.99,0:09:38.24,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\an8\fs18\blur0.3\c&H947F38&\fax0.05\frx10\fry2\pos(368,220)\frz21.91}Masahide Yamada
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.99,0:09:38.24,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fnGeorgia\an8\fs8\b1\blur0.3\c&H4C3F17&\fax0.05\frx10\fry2\frz19.53\pos(265.5,222.5)}Name:
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.99,0:09:38.24,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fnGeorgia\an8\fs8\b1\blur0.3\c&H4C3F17&\fax0.05\frx10\fry2\frz19.53\pos(223.5,213)}Joint\N\hSurety
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.75,0:09:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even when I ended up buried in\Ndebt, it didn't seem to matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.11,0:09:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or when my payment was demanded,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.35,0:09:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it meant someone called the Puppet\NMaster turned me into a hitman for some gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.57,0:09:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I could think was, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.97,0:09:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Yamada, you're a new man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.51,0:10:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miniature bombs have been surgically\Nplanted in your wrist, ankles, and head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.61,0:10:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, you're permanently armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.73,0:10:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Press the switch in your back\Ntooth at the moment of impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.09,0:10:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The explosion will take out\Nyour target and an extremity.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.33,0:10:16.90,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur0.3\bord0\shad0\fscx90\fs60\c&H8477F3&\pos(519,18)}Explosion\NRoulette
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.87,0:10:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A real explosion roulette.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.69,0:10:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As of this moment, your only purpose\Nin life is to go out with a bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.75,0:10:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If things went sideways, I could\Ntake myself out with the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.97,0:10:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the first time in my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.81,0:10:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I felt the fire live within me, all\Nthanks to the explosion roulette.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.31,0:10:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then he stole it from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.61,0:11:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.63,0:11:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this range, setting off the bomb\Nin my brain will take him out, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.11,0:11:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about using my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.29,0:11:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I disarmed it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.27,0:11:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to be afraid of dying now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.21,0:11:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like that, it was over!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That inseparable freak took away my only\Npassion just to feel good about himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.33,0:11:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he sold what I love,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.13,0:11:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,haven't I also got the right to take\Naway what he values most in life?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.57,0:11:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got new limbs courtesy of the\Npuppet master as an advance,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,made out like a bandit\Ndoing loads of crap jobs,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.61,0:11:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all the while waiting for this day\Nto come, and you're not stopping me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.07,0:11:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's right, you're already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.51,0:11:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thank you for being so understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.71,0:11:56.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate this sushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.85,0:11:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.71,0:12:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.62,0:12:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say something doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.41,0:12:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no decent person holds a\Ngrudge against the bug master.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.25,0:12:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we didn't hire a clown\Nfor the entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.31,0:12:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's hear from a friend of the groom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.15,0:12:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gedo officially owes me the most expensive\Ndinner in the history of dinners.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.07,0:12:29.03,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs28\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(320,277)}The Bug Master's {\alpha&HFF&\t(120,121,\alpha&H00&)}Wedding
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.89,0:12:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really pouring now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.39,0:12:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so much for a\Ngorgeous view of the sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.13,0:12:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please welcome a dear\Nfriend of the groom, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.89,0:12:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru Gero.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.03,0:12:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.37,0:12:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apologies, Gero came down\Nwith a case of stage fright.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.01,0:12:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he prepared a speech he\Nasked me to read on his behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.51,0:12:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Mei Kinosaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.49,0:12:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.49,0:13:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you a mess, Kevin?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.83,0:13:03.64,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur0.3\bord0\shad0\fscx90\fs40\c&HDFCDEF&\pos(254,14)}Explosion Roulette: Prosthetic Edition
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.17,0:13:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So break out your modified\Nbloodline! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.07,0:13:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.98,0:13:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You scared? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.01,0:13:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if I'd waste it on the likes of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.87,0:13:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toshiki, Anna, congratulations\Non such a wonderful wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm being honest, that's not something\NI imagined I would ever hear myself say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.65,0:13:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.67,0:13:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you know, I'm also hoping\Nto walk down the aisle soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.99,0:13:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And let me tell you, it's hard as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.23,0:13:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only my younger self\Ncould see me now, he'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.55,0:13:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, you're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.95,0:13:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.59,0:13:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a reason I'm ready to embrace life\Nand open myself up to someone special.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.63,0:13:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I was lucky enough to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.53,0:13:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toshiki, when I was just some punk\Nkid going through the motions,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.19,0:14:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why did you decide to care about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On behalf of that kid,\NI'd like to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.19,0:14:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you weren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.29,0:14:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'd be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.21,0:14:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't matter what you were facing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.63,0:14:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never let it stop you from reaching\Nout to someone who needed help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.61,0:14:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what makes you my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.73,0:14:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the coolest guy I've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.05,0:14:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want the memory of today\Nstained with your blood, so beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.29,0:14:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems you're in a bit of trouble, Yamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.01,0:14:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stand by my products.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.49,0:14:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll release your limiters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.57,0:14:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blow them all away with a\NTyphoon-level blast wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.67,0:15:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a real big surprise\Nfor you, Bug Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.11,0:15:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.09,0:15:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It ain't fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.47,0:15:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're deeper into the underworld\Nthan a lonely hitman like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.09,0:15:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A weapon of mass destruction more\Ndangerous than the exploding man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.27,0:15:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how did you have it in\Nyou to embrace me so gently?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.01,0:15:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yamada, you're going the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.97,0:15:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.13,0:15:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider this my farewell gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.87,0:15:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lastly, Anna, it goes without saying,\Nbut the moment that you found Toshiki,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.03,0:16:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your happily ever after was guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.25,0:16:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.81,0:16:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.97,0:16:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you'd be so kind, please\Ntake a look out of the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.13,0:16:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toshiki, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.61,0:16:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to thank you, Kinosaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.45,0:16:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just for the speech, but\Nfor helping Gero find a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.31,0:16:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.33,0:16:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My contributions are small potatoes\Ncompared to all you've given him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.55,0:17:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, even when Gero was a moody\Nteenager, you never left his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.01,0:17:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While that may be true, I'm the\None who should be thanking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.75,0:17:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.66,0:17:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the power dynamic\Nbetween our families,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.63,0:17:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone in his position shouldn't be\Nmy friend, much less attend my wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.33,0:17:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.07,0:17:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What power dynamic?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was kind of under the impression both\Nof you were masters and there wasn't one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.33,0:17:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Hanamaki Bug Masters\Nstarted with venomous insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.29,0:17:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Tsunagi Needlemasters with poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.63,0:17:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are other masters that specialize\Nin diseases and physical ailments.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But our branch families,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.55,0:17:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we recognize the Poison Clan as our ancestors\Nand answer to them without question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.73,0:17:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are only five great\Nfamilies at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.95,0:17:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Gero family, the Arashiyama family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.19,0:17:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Dogo, the Kirishima, and the Nasuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.91,0:18:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire society of masters\Nis made up of their families,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.91,0:18:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,branch families, and their offshoots.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.45,0:18:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clans not related to them are rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.13,0:18:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If one of the great families told\Na branching one their time was up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.63,0:18:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they would off themselves\Nwithout complaint.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.21,0:18:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how low we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.39,0:18:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully, Toshiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.17,0:18:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our family we live only thanks\Nto the ghetto's good graces.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.57,0:18:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For centuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the heads of the five great households\Nhave been toying with human lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.65,0:18:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're absolute monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.91,0:18:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never assume they share any of our values.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.63,0:18:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They see the lives of enemies and allies\Nas nothing but pawns to enrich their clans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So unless you want our line to\Nend, shut up and do as you're told.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.67,0:19:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's no need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.73,0:19:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, raise your heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.23,0:19:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Master Hikaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.97,0:19:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was tentatively named\Nheir the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.39,0:19:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't afraid when I first met Gero.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.69,0:19:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What struck me most was\Nhow he seemed, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.03,0:19:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are but lowly worms.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.21,0:19:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We owe our very lives to the\Ngenerosity of the Gero family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.47,0:19:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all we have time for.\NYes, sir. Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Hikaru, please use and discard this\Nboy's life as if it were a lowly insect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.41,0:19:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.81,0:19:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look like an insect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.07,0:20:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was just a guy even though everyone\Nelse around him was terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.61,0:20:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw a normal kid. Yep, a regular old joe
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.89,0:20:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when I told pops we were drinking buddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.73,0:20:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His mouth started foaming\Nand he passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.07,0:20:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ms. Kinosaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.71,0:20:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be a hundred times more difficult\Nthan it was for me or the Needle Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.17,0:20:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But please, help him find\Nus happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.05,0:20:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will, but yeah, it's gonna be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.71,0:20:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He freezes up at just\Nthe sight of a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.57,0:20:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.27,0:20:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know where you're coming from though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.53,0:20:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a really good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.47,0:20:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, I'm going to find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.25,0:20:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His perfect match to share his life with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.97,0:21:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since when did Kinosaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.21,0:21:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saki become such
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.27,0:21:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,good friends with my work buddies?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.75,0:21:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What What are those three plotting?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.95,0:21:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me tag along on your next fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.49,0:21:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have a brood to take care of?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.29,0:21:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you go, a hundred\Nmillion blessings, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.99,0:21:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy honeymoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.81,0:21:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh yeah he had like a\Npointy thing on the end of
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.19,0:21:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a pole and was pretty\Ngood at waving it around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.51,0:22:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. But apart from that, he\Nwas sort of normal? Great work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.33,0:22:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as always right i'm sending over\Nthe next list of masters now.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.78,0:22:02.90,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\b1\fscx90\an1\fs12\pos(366,209)\c&H548D96&}Poison Master
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.78,0:22:02.90,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\b1\fscx90\an1\fs16\pos(366,240)\c&H548D96&}Hikaru Gero
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.78,0:22:02.90,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\b1\fscx90\an1\fs12\pos(366,307)\c&H548D96&\t(640,641,\c&H636B6E&)}Spear Master
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.78,0:22:02.90,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\b1\fscx90\an1\fs16\pos(366,338)\c&H548D96&\t(640,641,\c&H636B6E&)}Nagahiko Kushima
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.15,0:22:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck wiping out those Hitman.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.00,0:22:12.74,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\b1\fscx80\fax-0.18\an1\fs7\c&H548D96&\frz347.4\pos(260.5,222)}Poison Master
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.00,0:22:12.74,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\b1\fscx80\fax-0.18\an1\fs11\c&H548D96&\frz347.4\pos(253,240.5)}Hikaru Gero
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.69,0:23:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be creepy. Oh, make a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.45,0:23:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be creepy. Oh, make a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.67,0:23:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.97,0:23:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no love has been filled.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.03,0:23:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You love me from my Step, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.89,0:23:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be moving altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.69,0:23:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to watch pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.73,0:23:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You love me from my Step, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.43,0:23:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to watch this real dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.27,0:23:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.81,0:23:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,10,000 yen a day!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.84,0:23:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.76,0:23:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meet him to the punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.75,0:23:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be over the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.66,0:23:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please dine.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:53.22,0:23:56.27,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs26\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(320,278)}The Hitman Hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.58,0:23:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, the Hitman Hunter.

